   "commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION",
   "note": {
    "texts": [
     {
      "value": "Enriched at the nuclear periphery and around the nucleolus (PubMed:12196509). In mitotic cells, localizes to kinetochores from prometaphase to metaphase (PubMed:18772885). At anaphase onset, transfers to the spindle midzone and then to the mid-body in telophase and cytokinesis (PubMed:18772885)"
     }
    ]
   },
